REPRO (both `karac run` JIT and `karac build` AOT wrong; `karac run --interp` right):

    fn main() {
        let mut s: Set[i64] = Set.new();
        s.insert(97i64);
        let x = 97u8;
        println(f"contains={s.contains(x)}");   // interp: true   compiled: FALSE
